flowchart LR
  Analyst[Analyst: exact catalog question] --> API[FastAPI /v1/query]
  API --> Generator[Deterministic intent-to-SQL catalog]
  Generator -->|unsupported| Refusal[Refused verdict]
  Generator --> Validator[SQL guardrails]
  Validator -->|single SELECT; allowed schema; EXPLAIN; LIMIT 100| DuckDB[(Local DuckDB fixture)]
  Validator -->|invalid / hallucinated| Refusal
  DuckDB --> Verdict[Trusted verdict: SQL, checks, preview]
  API --> Telemetry[OpenTelemetry span + structured fields]
